<title>USA: Communique names Kalomiris CEO.</title>
<headline>Communique names Kalomiris CEO.</headline>
<dateline>ALAMEDA, Calif. 1997-07-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>CommUnique Wireless Corp said Thursday it named Vasilios Kalomiris chief executive officer, a new office at the company.</p>
<p>Kalomiris previously served as project manager of the commercial communications technology laboratory at the U.S. Army Communications and Electronics Command, Space and Terrestrial Communications Directorate. In that job, he evaluated and selected promising commercial communications products.</p>
